---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro"
---

<Layout>
	<div class="introduction">
		<img class="profile-picture" src="/darketomaly_profile_picture.png" alt="Darketomaly profile picture">
		<div>
			<h1>Darketomaly</h1>
			<p>遊戲開發人員，擁有5年專業製作同運送電子遊戲經驗。現就讀香港理工大學創新多媒體娛樂碩士。</p>
			<p>Game developer with 5 years of professional experience building and shipping video games. Currently studying MSc in Innovative Multimedia Entertainment at The Hong Kong Polytechnic University.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.introduction {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 10rem minmax(0, 1fr);
		align-items: stretch;
		align-content: center;
		gap: 1.25rem;
		width: min(90%, 40rem);
		min-height: 90vh;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.profile-picture {
		width: 10rem;
		height: auto;
		border-radius: 13px;
		object-fit: cover;
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 2.5rem);
	}

	p {
		max-width: 32rem;
		margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
		color: #b8c1c8;
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	@media (max-width: 30rem) {
		.introduction {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			align-items: stretch;
			gap: 1rem;
		}

		.profile-picture {
			justify-self: center;
			width: 8rem;
			height: 8rem;
		}
	}
</style>